=== tb_bit
--- event-driven, four-state simulator
tb_bit:   q=xx, no clock edge yet (reset never happened)
--- statically scheduled, two-state simulator
tb_bit:   q=00, no clock edge yet (reset never happened)
=== tb_logic
--- event-driven, four-state simulator
tb_logic: q=a5, no clock edge yet (reset happened)
--- statically scheduled, two-state simulator
tb_logic: q=00, no clock edge yet (reset never happened)
=== tb_fixed
--- event-driven, four-state simulator
tb_fixed: q=a5, no clock edge yet (reset happened)
--- statically scheduled, two-state simulator
tb_fixed: q=a5, no clock edge yet (reset happened)
verdict: only the manufactured edge resets on both simulators
